scenario s over p
  tally 2
  from 2026-10-01

version s_rows
  cite s
  governs 2026-10..
  known 2026-10-02
  anchor konto
  replace opening[konto] = 2 000.00 PLN at 2026-10-01 start "s"
  stated[konto] = 2 500.00 PLN at 2026-10-20 end "s"

ask q_s_why: explain bal(konto, 2026-10-31) in s

ask q_s_open: opening[konto] in s law 2026-10-01

ask q_s_stated: stated[konto] in s law 2026-10-20
